OL,3,GNEWSACliff lift closed due to public
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coastal cliff lift has been closed
OL,7,Fwith immediate effect to ensure public
OL,8,Fsafety, North Yorkshire Council has
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FAn assessment of Scarborough Spa Cliff
OL,12,FLift, which was built in 1875, found "a
OL,13,Fnumber of issues" with its
OL,14,Finfrastructure and critical components,
OL,15,Fresulting in its closure.
OL,17,FCouncillor Carl Les said "the lift is
OL,18,Fan important part of Scarborough's
OL,19,Fhistory and identity" but no decisions
OL,20,Fhad been made "regarding the scope of
OL,21,Fany future works, timescales or funding
OL,22,Farrangements".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
