OL,3,GNEWSACliff lift closed due to public
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe findings would be assessed in
OL,7,Fdetail and further updates would be
OL,8,Fshared "in due course", the council
OL,9,Fadded.
